00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:30.620
The these folks have to be made examples out
of and threw away his career.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:34.010
No longer licensed, licensed as a pharmacist.

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:35.010
Not good times.

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:39.460
Not good times for Mr Brandenberg, but it
has to be taken seriously.

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:43.900
My question for you is, is three years the
right sentence?

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:48.110
Prosecutors asking for four years, three months,
